<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT  - Nissan reduced.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT  - Nissan reduced.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it cut the rating on Nissan Motor Co Ltd to underperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- analyst not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- ADRs ended at 12-31/32 on Friday.</p>
